'''Donny the lad''' is one of the three named [[bandit]]s that can be found in the [[Wilderness Bandit Camp]], along with [[Speedy Keith]] and [[Black Heather]]. 

Although he has a Talk-to option, attempting to do so will display the message {{mes|Donny the Lad is not interested in talking.}}

